#### 4.2.4 \(\pi^{0}\)-trigger selection

##### Selection of pseudorapidity of neutral clusters as trigger particles

The trigger particles are \(\pi^{0}\)'s reconstructed from the BEMC which span the range of \(|\eta|<1.0\). The Fig. 4.8 and Fig. 4.9 show the multiplicity of TPC

